Package: ReCoNet
Title: A comprehensive toolkit for omics network comparison and replication 
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Thao Vu
Maintainer: Thao Vu <thao.3.vu@cuanschutz.edu>
Description: The software provides distance metrics and permutation frameworks to statistically assess differences between input adjacency matrices. In addition, the software implements a projection ap-proach to transform high-dimensional networks into simplified representations, which are used to quantify network association with outcomes to evaluate replicability. 
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
Imports:
